  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.2.0 — differential-audit remediation and RPC/WebSocket hardening. WebSocket PubSub now fans Agave-deduplicated subscriptions out to every matching local subscriber, unsubscribes only the final consumer, and safely handles late acknowledgements and closing-route races. Transfer-hook TLV decoding now validates the complete buffer and exact ListView storage contract. Alpenglow signer bitmaps accept the full 515-byte envelope; message compilation snapshots bounded instruction inputs; PDA bump search matches 255 through 1; malformed account/error responses consistently surface as JsonException; and RPC batches isolate attributable malformed entries while retaining batch-wide rejection for ambiguous ids. Adds pinned loader, curve, BIP-39, BLS, confidential-token, and PDA parity vectors, and documents intentional runtime/client decoder and pathological Ed25519-verifier differences. Full details: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/v3.2.0/CHANGELOG.md",
